# Keep secrets, local environments, caches, and the (multi-GB) raw data
# files out of the build context entirely — not just out of the final
# image, out of what gets sent to the Docker daemon at all.

.env
.env.example
.venv/
.git/
.gitignore

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/

data/
*.parquet

docs/
README.md
tests/
conftest.py